    "body": "Once we get #4018 merged, we will want to implement the following as customer events:\r\n\r\n\tModel changes\r\n\t\t- [ ] Add a CustomerEvent model and types\r\n\r\n\tNew Customer Events\r\n\t\t- [ ] the order was placed\r\n\t\t- [ ] a note was added to the order\r\n\t\t- [ ] downloaded digital link\r\n\r\n\tNew Staff Events\r\n\t\t- [ ] A customer was deleted\r\n\r\n\tGraphQL Changes\r\n\t\t- [ ] A countable object from the CustomerEvent model\r\n\t\t- [ ] A `events` field in `customer`",
